**********************************************************************
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
*      LOAD ROUTINE                                                  *J
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
**********************************************************************

* FUNCTION   THIS ROUTINE ALLOWS THE INFORMATION PREVIOUSLY PLACED IN
*            TEMPORARY STORAGE BY THE VERIFY AND PREPARE TO LOAD
*            ROUTINE TO BE TRANSFERRED TO THE PERMANENT MEMORY
*            LOCATIONS SPECIFIED.

* ENTRIES    LD       ENTER TO LOAD PREPARED INFORMATION

       ORG     FBR1,D.DATA

LDPTR  BSS     1
LDEND  BSS     1
       USE     DAT
LDAREA CDSD    0,16
       STO     360
       USE     INST
LDMASK OCT     777776076

LD     CLA     =O23
       HOP     ISS          ISSUE STATUS CODE                         P

       CLA     LDPEND       PREPARED TO LOAD                          Q
       TNZ     LD1                                                    Y

       CLA     LDEM1        PREPARE ERROR MESSAGE, ENTERED THIS       N
*                           ROUTINE WHEN NOT PREP TO LOAD OR WHILE IN B
*                           VERIFY ONLY                               B
       HOP     EMS          ERROR MONITOR                             P

LDOUT  CLA     INPTL        IS RETURN TO MODE SORT                    Q
       TNZ     *+2                                                    N
       HOP     MDSRT        EXIT TO MODE SORT                         X
       HOP     MDSRT        FIXME: EXIT PREP TO LAUNCH                X

LD1    CLA     INPTL        CALLED FROM PREPARE TO LAUNCH             Q
       TNZ     LD2                                                    Y
       HOP     CWS          CW EXECUTE                                P
*                           LOAD TEMPORARY STORED DATA INTO           B
*                           DESIGNATED LOC                            B
       TRA     LDOUT

LD2    CLA     CWCLA        ARE ALL LOADS SET FOR RIGHT AREA          Q
       STO     LDPTR
       ADD     LDPEND
       STO     LDEND

LD3    CLA     LDPTR
       HOP     IEDA         PICK UP NEXT CONTROL WORD                 P
       XOR     LDAREA
       AND     LDMASK
       TNZ     LDBAD

       CLA     LDPTR
       ADD     D.KB19
       STO     LDPTR
       SUB     LDEND
       TNZ     LD3

       HOP     CWS          CONT WORD EXEC                            P
       HOP     MDSRT        FIXME: EXIT PREP TO LNCH                  X

LDBAD  CLA     LDEM2        PREP ERR MSG-TRIED TO LOAD ILLEGAL ADDRESSB
       HOP     EMS          ERROR MONITOR                             P
       HOP     MDSRT        FIXME: EXIT PREP TO LNCH                  X
